        "original_id": "bdffbc9f-7354-5979-ac92-80f96969b0ab",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2007 Canadian Grand Prix, 2017 Canadian Grand Prix\n- Places: Circuit Gilles Villeneuve, Montreal, Quebec, Canada\n- Organizations: FIA, Formula One\n- People: Lewis Hamilton\n\nFacts:\n- The 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 10 June 2007 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Lewis Hamilton's win at the 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was his first win in Formula One and made him the first black driver to win a Formula One race.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is a motor racing circuit in Montreal, Quebec, Canada, and its French name is also spelled Circuit Gilles-Villeneuve.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is the venue for the FIA Formula One Canadian Grand Prix.\n- The 2017 Canadian Grand Prix, formally known as the Formula 1 Grand Prix du Canada 2017, was a Formula One motor race held on 11 June 2017 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.",
